,"line":60,"embedded":true},{"title":"paid severance","target":"https://boisedev.com/news/2020/02/19/dave-bieter-severance-pence/","line":66}],"metadata":{"title":"McLean authorizes large severance payment to departed chief of staff","source":"https://boisedev.com/news/2026/05/19/mclean-authorizes-large-severance-payment-to-departed-chief-of-staff/?utm_source=newsletters.idahocapitalsun.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=primary-had-30-voter-turnout-risch-challenged-to-debate-column-act-would-help-alzheimer-s-patients&_bhlid=50d7216f7df65253834d5494ef7348304c916d70","author":["[[Don Day - BoiseDev Editor]]"],"published":"2026-05-19","created":"2026-07-08","description":"The City of Boise paid a large severance payment to departed Chief of Staff Courtney Washburn after her departure earlier this year. The city paid Washburn $196,593.12, according to the records obtained by BoiseDev under the Idaho Public Records Act. The payment included $112,845 in severance, $76,684.35 in unused leave time, and a $7,063.77 benefit […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},